window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/c368-cc81d265226c58f5.json"]={sha256:"cc81d265226c58f51fb3dcbb2b9a711155997240a8659947f4e8a7d84159bd2c",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v24-case-b581142d591a0666","url":"https://science.nasa.gov/mission/lucy/","title":"Lucy Trojan-asteroid mission — NASA Science","titleEn":"Lucy Trojan-asteroid mission — NASA Science","publisher":"NASA","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"c368","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"c368","related":[{"id":"c369","referenceUrls":["https://science.nasa.gov/mission/psyche/"],"title":"Psyche 小行星探測","titleEn":"Psyche asteroid mission","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：若教學追蹤能力上限 0.30°/s，1000 km 情境需重新規劃；距離增加會犧牲空間解析度。 每項結論須附輸入、單位、版本與未解限制。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: With a teaching tracking limit of 0.30°/s, the 1000 km case needs replanning; greater distance reduces spatial resolution. Attach inputs, units, revision and unresolved limitations to each conclusion.","difference":"用質量與形狀模型估算平均密度，分析半徑誤差如何放大。","differenceEn":"Estimate bulk density from mass and shape, analyzing amplification of radius error.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["以下皆為教學假設，非實際任務參數。合成橫向速度 6 km/s、最近接距離 1000 km。 先按量綱手算，再以試算表獨立列式。教學名義算例：ω=(6/1000)×180/π。 結果約 0.343775 deg/s。最近接瞬間 ω≈v⊥/r，為局部小角度模型；離開最近接時需用完整相對向量。","以下皆為教學假設，非實際任務參數。合成質量 2×10¹⁹ kg、等效半徑 100 km，先換為公尺。 先按量綱手算，再以試算表獨立列式。教學名義算例：ρ=2×10¹⁹/(4π×100000³/3)。 結果約 4774.65 kg/m³。球形教學模型 ρ=M/(4πr³/3)；真實不規則體應用網格體積，孔隙率造成成分歧義。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["All values are teaching assumptions, not mission specifications. Use synthetic transverse speed 6 km/s and closest approach 1000 km. Calculate by hand with units, then independently formulate a worksheet. Synthetic nominal case: ω=(6/1000)×180/π. Result ≈ 0.343775 deg/s. At closest approach ω≈v⊥/r is a local small-angle model; other times require the full relative vector.","All values are teaching assumptions, not mission specifications. Use synthetic mass 2×10¹⁹ kg and equivalent radius 100 km, converted to meters. Calculate by hand with units, then independently formulate a worksheet. Synthetic nominal case: ρ=2×10¹⁹/(4π×100000³/3). Result ≈ 4774.65 kg/m³. The spherical teaching model is ρ=M/(4πr³/3); a real irregular body needs mesh volume and porosity complicates composition.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"c378","referenceUrls":["https://www.nasa.gov/reference/the-space-shuttle/"],"title":"Space Shuttle 太空梭工程史","titleEn":"Space Shuttle engineering history","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：若教學追蹤能力上限 0.30°/s，1000 km 情境需重新規劃；距離增加會犧牲空間解析度。 每項結論須附輸入、單位、版本與未解限制。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: With a teaching tracking limit of 0.30°/s, the 1000 km case needs replanning; greater distance reduces spatial resolution. Attach inputs, units, revision and unresolved limitations to each conclusion.","difference":"從動能尺度理解再入能量管理，區分總耗散能與局部熱流。","differenceEn":"Use kinetic-energy scale to understand entry energy management, separating total dissipation from local heat flux.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["以下皆為教學假設，非實際任務參數。合成橫向速度 6 km/s、最近接距離 1000 km。 先按量綱手算，再以試算表獨立列式。教學名義算例：ω=(6/1000)×180/π。 結果約 0.343775 deg/s。最近接瞬間 ω≈v⊥/r，為局部小角度模型；離開最近接時需用完整相對向量。","以下皆為教學假設，非實際任務參數。教學質量 80000 kg、速度 7500 m/s，以 GJ 報告。 先按量綱手算，再以試算表獨立列式。教學名義算例：E=0.5×80000×7500²/10⁹。 結果約 2250 GJ。平移動能 E=mv²/2；不是全部都進入熱防護，忽略勢能與旋轉。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["All values are teaching assumptions, not mission specifications. Use synthetic transverse speed 6 km/s and closest approach 1000 km. Calculate by hand with units, then independently formulate a worksheet. Synthetic nominal case: ω=(6/1000)×180/π. Result ≈ 0.343775 deg/s. At closest approach ω≈v⊥/r is a local small-angle model; other times require the full relative vector.","All values are teaching assumptions, not mission specifications. Use teaching mass 80000 kg and speed 7500 m/s; report in GJ. Calculate by hand with units, then independently formulate a worksheet. Synthetic nominal case: E=0.5×80000×7500²/10⁹. Result ≈ 2250 GJ. Translational E=mv²/2 is not all absorbed by thermal protection and excludes potential and rotational energy.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v24-case-9f595279d82b6cf7","url":"https://science.nasa.gov/mission/psyche/","title":"Psyche asteroid mission — NASA Science","titleEn":"Psyche asteroid mission — NASA Science","publisher":"NASA","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v24-case-3057b76566dc5edf","url":"https://www.nasa.gov/reference/the-space-shuttle/","title":"NASA The Space Shuttle","titleEn":"NASA The Space Shuttle","publisher":"NASA","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
